From b2f22d6d6bf6785bbaed397ff4d39369c3165b3e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Schiffhauer <Alexander.Schiffhauer@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:16:02 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 09/12] input: Add an optional libinput touchscreen provider

Separate seat and device lifecycle from splash rendering. Report calibrated touch coordinates, cancellation and hotplug events through an opaque interface, expose output associations, and suspend devices when inactive. Builds without libinput or udev retain ordinary keyboard support.
---
 meson.build                              |   6 +
 meson_options.txt                        |   5 +
 src/libply-splash-core/meson.build       |   6 +
 src/libply-splash-core/ply-touch-input.c | 334 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/libply-splash-core/ply-touch-input.h |  56 ++++
 5 files changed, 407 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/libply-splash-core/ply-touch-input.c
 create mode 100644 src/libply-splash-core/ply-touch-input.h

